WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.011
Question four. Highlight: a “rain sensor” used to “measure” live rainfall — what class of device?

00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:11.564
Useful: a sensor feeds measured values into the system = input.

00:00:11.564 --> 00:00:16.479
Useless: where the weather station sits — does not change the class.

00:00:16.479 --> 00:00:18.647
Option A. Input device — keep.

00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:23.273
Option B. Output device: a sensor does not output results — cut.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:27.609
Option C. Display device: stem never mentions display — cut.

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:31.874
Option D. Print device: stem never mentions printing — cut.

00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:35.271
Measure then feed in — that is an input device.

00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:37.728
Therefore the correct answer is A.
